1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
[both gasp]

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I am the Shadow Beast, Worm.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Which family do you belong to?

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,000
[Dalzollene] We’re bodyguards.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
We’ve been hired by the Nostrade family.

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
I understand.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
It seems that you can use Nen a bit

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,000
but don’t bother.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
These are no ordinary thugs

10
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
To them, killing’s a part
of their daily routine.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,000
You could say
they’re professional killers.

12
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
And as pros ourselves, we’ll handle it.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,000
My name’s Rabid Dog.

14
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
And mine is Leech.

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
You, uh... can call me Porcupine.

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Sit back and leave this job
to the Shadow Beasts.

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,000
[theme song playing]

18
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:22,000
BUILDUP x TO A x FIERCE BATTLE

19
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:35,000
[narrator] After the Phantom Troupe’s raid
on the Underground Auction,

20
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Uvogin has single-handedly
annihilated the Mafia pursuers.

21
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:44,000
But now they look on
as the Mafia’s secret weapon arrives,

22
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:46,000
dispatched by the Ten Dons:

23
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,000
The Shadow Beasts.

24
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,000
[mafioso straining]

25
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,000
That was boring.

26
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,000
Not one of ‘em put up much of a fight.

27
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
[Shalnark] Uvo!

28
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Yeah?

29
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,000
They’re here now!

30
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,000
[Uvogin chuckles]

31
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,000
[Uvogin] Hey, don’t interfere!

32
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,000
You got that?

33
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,000
I haven’t even had the chance
to enjoy myself.

34
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,000
[Feitan] Oh, boy.

35
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Oh, just let Uvo handle it.

36
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Want in on a round, Feitan?

37
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,000
[Squala] Wait…

38
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
is he planning to fight the Shadow Beasts
all by himself?

39
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,000
[Uvogin] The Shadow Beasts, huh?

40
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,000
Where’d you hide the merchandise?

41
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,000
What happened to the guards and guests?

42
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
We killed them.

43
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,000
Where’s the merchandise?

44
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:14,000
If you don’t answer me…

45
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,000
[Worm gasps in shock]

46
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:29,000
That one stung.

47
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:33,000
[grunts, rasping in pain]

48
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,000
[grunting]

49
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,000
Huh?

50
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,000
[Worm chuckling]

51
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:53,000
You can’t escape now.

52
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,000
What’ll it be? Hmm?

53
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Have me kill you underground?

54
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Or would you rather die
at the hands of the other three

55
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
up on the surface?

56
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,000
Idiot.

57
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:21,000
[Feitan] Oh!

58
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Here we go.

59
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,000
Uvo is getting pretty serious.

60
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Four.

61
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,000
You talk a pretty good game.

62
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,000
But can you back it up?

63
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,000
[Worm groans]

64
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:57,000
BIG BANG IMPACT:
FIST OF DESTRUCTION

65
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:03,000
[Squala] I-- I don’t believe it!

66
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:07,000
[Basho] I’ve never seen a Nen user
of this caliber before.

67
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,000
Is that…?

68
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,000
It’s a spider tattoo.

69
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,000
Then, he's...

70
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,000
[loud heartbeat]

71
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,000
[Kurapika's loud heartbeat]

72
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,000
[loud heartbeat]

73
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,000
Spiders…

74
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,000
That poor guy.

75
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,000
There’s not much left of him.

76
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:02,000
[Nobunaga] Uvo’s Big Bang Impact
sure packs a powerful punch.

77
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:07,000
but to be fair, it’s just a regular punch
with Nen added.

78
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,000
Eight.

79
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,000
[Shizuku] Nine.

80
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,000
[Shalnark] Ten.

81
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:16,000
Okay. So, who wants to die next?

82
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
[Rabid Dog] The Phantom Troupe, huh?

83
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:21,000
[Porcupine]
Well, he seems pretty confident. Yup.

84
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:24,000
I think it’s your turn.

85
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:26,000
Oh, you’re in for it now.

86
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:30,000
[Uvogin laughs] Nice!

87
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:32,000
Gotta love reckless opponents!

88
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Easy to kill!

89
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Huh?

90
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:40,000
I can manipulate my body hair, y’see.

91
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:43,000
I can even turn it
into these needles if I want to. Yup.

92
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,000
You throw a mean punch,

93
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
but it’s pointless
if you can’t connect. Yup.

94
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,000
-[Rabid Dog hisses]
-[Uvogin winces in pain]

95
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:00,000
[Feitan] They damaged Uvogin’s iron skin

96
00:08:00,000 --> 00:08:02,000
with nothing more
than body hair and teeth.

97
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,000
They must be really skilled Nen users.

98
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:07,000
I’m impressed, actually!

99
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,000
That’s thirteen.

100
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,000
[Shalnark] No way!

101
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,000
[Shizuku] Sorry.

102
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,000
You want a hand over there, Uvo?

103
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,000
-[Uvogin] Stay out of this!
-[depressed sigh]

104
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:22,000
Damn it. Come on!

105
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,000
[Porcupine] It’s futile.

106
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,000
There are thousands of needles
in your skin.

107
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
You can’t shake them off. Yup.

108
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Then I’ll just have to use you
as an extension of my fist!

109
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Huh?

110
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:41,000
Since I manipulate it at will,

111
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:45,000
I can relax sections of my hair
as necessary. Yup-yup yup.

112
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,000
[Uvogin winces in pain]

113
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,000
This is too easy, musclehead!

114
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,000
[Uvogin] That’s bull!

115
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,000
[gasps]

116
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,000
[Rabid Dog] What’s wrong, tough guy?

117
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,000
Finally kick in?

118
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,000
The sensation that you’re feeling

119
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:08,000
is the fast-acting neurotoxin
my fangs pumped into you.

120
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,000
[Uvogin] Bastard…

121
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,000
[Rabid Dog]
You won’t be affected from the neck up,

122
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,000
so you can still feel fear and pain.

123
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,000
Try and enjoy it.

124
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,000
If he were using lethal poison,

125
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,000
the fight would be all over now.

126
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
He probably enjoys torture.

127
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,000
-[slurping noise]
-Hey…

128
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,000
[Leech cackling]

129
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,000
I keep countless leeches
of lots of different sizes

130
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,000
stored within my body.

131
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,000
As we speak,

132
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:40,000
they’re entering your body
through your injuries

133
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:43,000
and soon they’ll lay their eggs
in your bladder.

134
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:47,000
These spotted leeches
are a gift from me to you.

135
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,000
You’re totally disgusting.

136
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,000
You know that?

137
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,000
[Leech cackling]

138
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Most die from the pain.

139
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,000
Hundreds of millions of leeches

140
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:59,000
hatching inside of your body
is excruciating

141
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
as you’re about to find out firsthand.

142
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:06,000
[Leech cackling]

143
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:13,000
[grunts of disgust] That’s awful.

144
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:17,000
I thought that ugly
usually meant better-tasting.

145
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:21,000
Surprised?

146
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:24,000
You’re not the only one
who can bite, y’know.

147
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
[chuckling]

148
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:29,000
Even without my body,

149
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:32,000
my neck and head are more than enough
to beat you.

150
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,000
They will lose.

151
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:47,000
The Shadow Beasts are dead.

152
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,000
They will lose.

153
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:04,000
The Shadow Beasts...

154
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,000
are dead.

155
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
[Rabid Dog]
You really still think you can win?

156
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:16,000
No way in hell you can bite me
when I’m all the way over here.

157
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,000
It’s impossible.

158
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
[smug chuckle]

159
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,000
A bullet? No.

160
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,000
It’s a chunk he bit out of Leech’s skull!

161
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:39,000
[focusing grunt]

162
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,000
[dying rasps]

163
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,000
[frightened gasp]

164
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,000
[Porcupine] If he tries that on me,
it’ll never work.

165
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:03,000
My body hair will deflect
any projectiles, yup.

166
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Huh?

167
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,000
[roaring]

168
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,000
[Kurapika grunts]

169
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:46,000
You can’t deflect bullets of sound,
can you?

170
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:48,000
What’s wrong, can’t you hear me?

171
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,000
[Basho] He used sound
to kill a Shadow Beast...

172
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:00,000
They’re crazy… Completely crazy!

173
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
Damn…

174
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,000
Hey, what the hell, you idiot?!

175
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,000
How about a warning next time?

176
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Do you wanna bust our eardrums, too?

177
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:11,000
[Uvogin] Sorry ‘bout that!

178
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,000
I didn’t want to give away my plan.

179
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:17,000
Besides, the sound took a while
to reach you guys, didn’t it?

180
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:20,000
You had plenty of time to cover your ears.

181
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,000
[Machi] That's true.

182
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,000
[Dalzollene] Kurapika, wait!

183
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,000
What are you doing?

184
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:30,000
[Kurapika] Isn't it obvious?

185
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:33,000
-I'm going to capture him.
-[Melody, Dalzollene, Squala, Basho] Huh?

186
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:34,000
That guy?!

187
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:37,000
No way! You saw what he did!

188
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,000
You’re gonna get yourself killed!

189
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,000
Stop, Kurapika!

190
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:43,000
It doesn’t matter.

191
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:55,000
I hear such violent rage and hatred.

192
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:58,000
He’s gone blind with it!

193
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,000
Kurapika!

194
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:07,000
[Melody] He’s walking
right into his own funeral.

195
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,000
I have to stop him.

196
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:12,000
[Dalzollene] Wait just a minute!

197
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:20,000
[angered growl]

198
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:25,000
[plays peaceful tune]

199
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:27,000
[gasps]

200
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:37,000
[peaceful tune continues]

201
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,000
“Field in Spring”.

202
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:28,000
The perfect composition for relaxing.

203
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:30,000
Now, has everyone calmed down?

204
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,000
If so, let’s plan our strategy

205
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,000
with level heads.

206
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:37,000
Yeah…

207
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:41,000
What kind of Nen abilities
do the other members possess?

208
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,000
[Squala] I’m willing to bet they’re all
ridiculously strong.

209
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:47,000
[Kurapika] Melody...

210
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:50,000
Thanks a lot.

211
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,000
I’ve calmed down.

212
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
But I’m still going to capture them.

213
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,000
-Leader.
-Hm?

214
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:00,000
I stand a good chance.

215
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,000
-[Melody, Squala, Basho, Linssen] Huh?
-What’s that?

216
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,000
Let me do it.

217
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:09,000
[Dalzollene] You saw
that incredible show of strength

218
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,000
and you still think you have a shot?

219
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,000
I do.

220
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,000
Understood.

221
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,000
We may need to leave quickly,

222
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,000
so please pull the car around.

223
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,000
[Squala] Right.

224
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,000
[Uvogin] Shizuku!

225
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,000
Do me a favor

226
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:34,000
and suck all the poison and leeches
out of my body!

227
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:36,000
Your vacuum could do it, right?

228
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Blinky can suck out the poison,

229
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,000
but nothing that’s still alive.

230
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,000
[Uvogin] Really?

231
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,000
Then what do I do?

232
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,000
Let me see.

233
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:52,000
This is known as a spotted leech.

234
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:55,000
It takes a nearly a full day for it
to migrate to the bladder

235
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:56,000
before laying its eggs and dying.

236
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,000
Yeah, then what?

237
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Well, after that,

238
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,000
the eggs will hatch and exit
through your urinary tract.

239
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,000
You’ll most likely die from the pain.

240
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:07,000
Come on, don’t joke around like that.

241
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:13,000
However, they require a very specific
concentration of ammonia to hatch.

242
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,000
If there isn't enough,

243
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:17,000
the eggs stay dormant
and can be excreted harmlessly.

244
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,000
Which means that until this time tomorrow

245
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:23,000
it’s absolutely critical
that you drink beer constantly

246
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,000
and pee as much as possible!

247
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:28,000
Is that all? You really had me worried!

248
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:31,000
Shizuku! Can you get the poison?

249
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,000
[Shizuku] Okay!

250
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,000
[Shalnark] Someone go into town
and get lots of beer.

251
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,000
All right, I’ll go.

252
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:39,000
And make sure those suckers are ice cold!

253
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:42,000
[Franklin] You’ll get what I bring you!

254
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:45,000
[cackling]

255
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,000
Hurry and get this poison out of me!

256
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,000
[gasps]

257
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:56,000
Huh?

258
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:01,000
[Uvogin screaming]

259
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,000
-Did you see that?
-Yeah.

260
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:16,000
Those chains came out of nowhere
and wrapped around his body!

261
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,000
Is it a new Shadow Beast?

262
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Uvo can’t move due to the neurotoxin

263
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:24,000
and those leeches
are still inside of him, too.

264
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,000
There’s no choice.
We gotta go and save him.

265
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,000
[Feitan] Oh, boy.

266
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,000
So much trouble.

267
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
[Machi] We can still find out
where he’s going.

268
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,000
I used In to make my thread invisible.

269
00:18:36,000 --> 00:18:38,000
I can follow them anywhere,

270
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:40,000
as long as they don’t spot the needle.

271
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:43,000
And they’d have to use Gyo to do that.

272
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:46,000
Well? Let’s find them
before they figure it out.

273
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:47,000
[derisive snort]

274
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:50,000
Now’s our chance to finish off
the other Shadow Beasts.

275
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:53,000
[Shalnark] Get as much beer
as you can, Franklin.

276
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:56,000
[Franklin snorts derisively]
Man, the chase sounds more fun.

277
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:59,000
[Shalnark laughs]
Come on. Let’s go!

278
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:02,000
[Worm] Indeed.

279
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,000
The spiders...

280
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:08,000
[weakly, dying] Listen to me…

281
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,000
Gather up everyone who’s left,

282
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,000
or we...

283
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:15,000
don't stand a chan--

284
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,000
Understood.

285
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:34,000
Chains, is it?

286
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,000
[Uvogin] Hey. Driver.

287
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:48,000
You don’t really think these chains
can hold me, do you?

288
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,000
Kill me now or you’ll regret it.

289
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,000
I promise you that.

290
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,000
Quiet.

291
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,000
Do you hear me?

292
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:00,000
This is the only chance
you’re ever gonna get.

293
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,000
Stop wasting time and--

294
00:20:04,000 --> 00:20:05,000
[surprised gasp of pain]

295
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:08,000
[groaning in pain]

296
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,000
I thought I told you to be quiet!

297
00:20:12,000 --> 00:20:14,000
Kurapika! Be careful!

298
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,000
Watch the road!

299
00:20:17,000 --> 00:20:20,000
[Uvogin] Damn… How can he be this strong?

300
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:23,000
Even if my body wasn’t paralyzed,

301
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:25,000
I’d still be having trouble.

302
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,000
I don’t know how

303
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:29,000
but he’s infused these puny chains

304
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,000
with enough Nen to keep me in check.

305
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,000
I’m a master Enhancer.

306
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,000
That shouldn’t even be possible!

307
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:43,000
Chain Jail…

308
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:44,000
CHAIN JAIL:
THE RESTRAINING MIDDLE FINGER

309
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:46,000
...an ability I will use
only on the Spiders.

310
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:51,000
A power to capture and restrain
the Phantom Troupe.

311
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:55,000
I’ve sworn to use it for no other purpose.

312
00:20:57,000 --> 00:20:59,000
If I break my vow…

313
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:03,000
if I should use this technique
on anyone other than a Spider…

314
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:05,000
my life is forfeit.

315
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,000
I would die...

316
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:09,000
instantly.

317
00:21:13,000 --> 00:21:17,000
A self-imposed condition
and a contract with myself.

318
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,000
The proof of my resolve.

319
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:20,000
CONDITION
CONTRACT

320
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:21,000
[Melody] Kurapika! Look out!

321
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,000
-[Kurapika] The risk is high...
-[Melody] Please, watch the road!

322
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,000
[Kurapika] ...but the greater the strength
of my conviction,

323
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:29,000
the stronger my Nen!

324
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:38,000
[narrator] Kurapika has captured
a member of the Phantom Troupe.

325
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:42,000
Armed with resolve
and the willingness to risk his life,

326
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:46,000
he prepares for the battle
that will soon begin.

327
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:50,000
[theme song playing]

328
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:56,000
[Gon] Coming up:

329
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:58,000
-Gon...
-[Killua] ...and Killua’s…

330
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,000
[both] Hunterpedia!

331
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:01,000
-I’m Gon!
-I’m Killua!

332
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,000
[both] And this is our Hunterpedia!

333
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:04,000
We’re introducing the Shadow Beasts!

334
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:07,000
A fighting force for the Mafia’s Ten Dons.

335
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,000
Okay, but who are they?

336
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:10,000
Owl… then there’s Worm… and Porcupine…

337
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:13,000
Let me see, now
what was the other one called… Oh, Leech!

338
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:19,000
[Gon] Next time: “Restraint x and x Vow”!

339
00:23:20,000 --> 00:23:22,000
Killua! Don’t run in the hallway!

340
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,000
[Killua] The Silent Gait
counts as walking.

341
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:26,000
[Gon] Follow the rules!
Promise me, okay?
